<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8"/>
  <title>Daily Japan Signals | Neon Tokyo Signals</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
  <meta name="description" content="Daily Japan equity decision board after the Tokyo close. Top 20 short-term screen with Trade, Monitor, Blocked High Score, market tape and risk controls."/>
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#050711"/>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/daily_jp.css?v={{ asset_version }}"/>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page-shell">
  <div class="ambient ambient-a"></div>
  <div class="ambient ambient-b"></div>
  <div class="ambient ambient-c"></div>
  <div class="grid"></div>
  <div class="scanline"></div>

  <main class="wrap">
    <header class="header">
      <a class="brand" href="/">
        <span class="brand-mark">NTS</span>
        <span><strong>NEON TOKYO SIGNALS</strong><em>Japan equity signals after the Tokyo close.</em></span>
      </a>
      <nav class="nav">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/japan/daily/" class="active">Daily</a>
        <a href="/japan/daily/backtest/">Backtest</a>
        <a href="/japan/weekly/">Weekly</a>
        <a href="/disclaimer/">Disclaimer</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="hero cockpit">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="kicker"><span class="live-dot"></span> DAILY JP DECISION BOARD · TOP {{ main_rank_limit }}</div>
        <h1>Five-second decision.<span>Zero signal ambiguity.</span></h1>
        <p>
          Top-ranked Japanese equity signals after the Tokyo close. Trade is the only actionable lane;
          Monitor Only means wait for next-day confirmation; Blocked means strength exists but the model is not ready.
        </p>
        <div class="verdict-card verdict-{{ setup_quality.verdict_tone }}">
          <div><span>Today’s model verdict</span><strong>{{ setup_quality.verdict }}</strong></div>
          <p>{{ setup_quality.verdict_text }}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="hero-panels asymmetric">
        <article class="hero-panel trade-panel">
          <div class="panel-label">TRADE SIGNAL</div>
          {% if trade_signal %}
            <div class="ticker-row"><strong>{{ trade_signal.symbol }}</strong><span class="tag triage-trade">Trade</span></div>
            <div class="panel-name">{{ trade_signal.name }}</div>
            <div class="panel-score">{{ trade_signal.score_display }} <span>pts</span></div>
            <div class="decision-line">{{ trade_signal.decision_label }}</div>
            <p>{{ trade_signal.decision_reason }}</p>
          {% else %}
            <div class="ticker-row no-action"><strong>NO TRADE</strong><span class="tag triage-ignore">Capital first</span></div>
            <div class="panel-name">No name cleared the full daily Trade threshold.</div>
            <div class="panel-score muted">0 <span>trades</span></div>
            <p>Monitor candidates are not buy signals. Wait for confirmation.</p>
          {% endif %}
        </article>

        <article class="hero-panel monitor-panel">
          <div class="panel-label">TOP MONITOR</div>
          {% if monitor_signal %}
            <div class="ticker-row"><strong>{{ monitor_signal.symbol }}</strong><span class="tag triage-watch">Monitor</span></div>
            <div class="panel-name">{{ monitor_signal.name }}</div>
            <div class="panel-score">{{ monitor_signal.score_display }} <span>pts</span></div>
            <div class="decision-line">{{ monitor_signal.decision_label }}</div>
            <p>{{ monitor_signal.decision_reason }}</p>
          {% else %}
            <div class="ticker-row no-action"><strong>NO MONITOR</strong><span class="tag triage-ignore">No trigger</span></div>
            <p>No Monitor candidate cleared the daily rules.</p>
          {% endif %}
        </article>

        <article class="hero-panel score-panel">
          <div class="panel-label">HIGHEST SCORE</div>
          {% if highest_score_item %}
            <div class="ticker-row"><strong>#{{ highest_score_item.rank }} {{ highest_score_item.symbol }}</strong><span class="tag triage-{{ (highest_score_item.triage or 'unknown') | lower }}">{{ highest_score_item.signal_status }}</span></div>
            <div class="panel-name">{{ highest_score_item.name }}</div>
            <div class="panel-score">{{ highest_score_item.score_display }} <span>pts</span></div>
            <div class="decision-line">{{ highest_score_item.decision_label }}</div>
            <p>{{ highest_score_item.decision_reason }}</p>
          {% else %}
            <div class="ticker-row no-action"><strong>NO DATA</strong></div>
            <p>Daily signal JSON has not been generated yet.</p>
          {% endif %}
        </article>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="meta-strip">
      <div><span>Generated</span><strong>{{ generated_at or "—" }}</strong></div>
      <div><span>Price Data</span><strong>{{ source_prices_generated_at or "—" }}</strong></div>
      <div><span>Regime</span><strong>{{ payload.regime or "—" }}</strong></div>
      <div><span>Universe</span><strong>{{ summary.items_count or all_items|length }} names</strong></div>
    </section>

    <section class="decision-summary" aria-label="5-second daily decision summary">
      <article class="summary-tile trade"><span>Trade</span><strong>{{ setup_quality.trade_count }}</strong><em>Actionable only</em></article>
      <article class="summary-tile watch"><span>Monitor Only</span><strong>{{ setup_quality.monitor_count }}</strong><em>Wait for confirmation</em></article>
      <article class="summary-tile blocked"><span>Blocked High Score</span><strong>{{ setup_quality.blocked_high_count }}</strong><em>Score ≥ {{ blocked_score_floor }}</em></article>
      <article class="summary-tile danger"><span>High Risk</span><strong>{{ setup_quality.high_risk_count }}</strong><em>Severe blockers</em></article>
      <article class="summary-tile favored"><span>Strict Favored</span><strong>{{ setup_quality.favored_count }}</strong><em>Validated setup flags</em></article>
    </section>

    <section class="visual-board">
      <div class="section-heading split-heading">
        <div><div class="kicker">5-SECOND READ</div><h2>Actionability before detail.</h2></div>
        <div class="method-chip">Primary Daily lens: 1D / 3D / 5D / 10D · 20D reference only</div>
      </div>
      <div class="visual-grid">
        <article class="visual-card large-bar-card">
          <div class="visual-title">Decision mix</div>
          <div class="stacked-bar jumbo" aria-label="Decision distribution">
            {% for bar in bar_data.triage_bars %}<span class="seg seg-{{ bar.label|lower|replace(' ', '-') }}" style="width:{{ bar.width }}%"></span>{% endfor %}
          </div>
          <div class="bar-legend big-legend">
            {% for bar in bar_data.triage_bars %}<span><i class="dot dot-{{ bar.label|lower|replace(' ', '-') }}"></i><strong>{{ bar.count }}</strong> {{ bar.label }}</span>{% endfor %}
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="visual-card">
          <div class="visual-title">Score distribution</div>
          <div class="score-bars">
            {% for bar in bar_data.score_bars %}<div><span>{{ bar.label }}</span><i style="width:{{ bar.width }}%"></i><strong>{{ bar.count }}</strong></div>{% endfor %}
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="visual-card">
          <div class="visual-title">Board role</div>
          <div class="role-meter"><div><strong>{{ main_items|length }}</strong><span>Main Top {{ main_rank_limit }}</span></div><div><strong>{{ reference_items|length }}</strong><span>Reference 21–{{ reference_limit }}</span></div></div>
          <p>Reference names are intentionally lightweight and not part of the core daily decision set.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="market-section">
      <div class="section-heading split-heading"><div><div class="kicker">MARKET CONTEXT</div><h2>Broad trend versus short-term tape.</h2></div><div class="method-chip">Risk-On trend can still have weak short-term tape</div></div>
      <div class="pulse-grid">
        {% for pulse in market_pulse %}
          <article class="pulse-card">
            <div class="pulse-top"><div><div class="pulse-label">{{ pulse.label }}</div><div class="pulse-regime">{{ pulse.broad_trend }}</div></div><div class="pulse-score">{{ pulse.pulse_score_0_100 | fmt_score }}<span>pulse</span></div></div>
            <div class="tape-badge">{{ pulse.short_tape }}</div>
            <div class="pulse-metrics"><div><span>1D</span><strong class="{{ pulse.return_1d_pct_class }}">{{ pulse.return_1d_pct | fmt_pct }}</strong></div><div><span>5D Tape</span><strong class="{{ pulse.return_5d_pct_class }}">{{ pulse.return_5d_pct | fmt_pct }}</strong></div><div><span>20D Trend</span><strong class="{{ pulse.return_20d_pct_class }}">{{ pulse.return_20d_pct | fmt_pct }}</strong></div></div>
          </article>
        {% else %}<article class="empty-card">Market pulse data is not available yet.</article>{% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="actionable-section">
      <div class="section-heading split-heading"><div><div class="kicker">TRADE / MONITOR BOARD</div><h2>Trade is actionable. Monitor is not.</h2></div><div class="method-chip">Monitor Only means wait for confirmation</div></div>
      <div class="cards action-cards">
        {% for item in trade_items + monitor_items %}
          <article class="signal-card {{ item.card_tone }} {{ item.score_class }}">
            <div class="card-top"><div class="rank">#{{ item.rank }}</div><div class="score">{{ item.score_display }}<span>pts</span></div></div>
            <div class="signal-tags"><span class="tag triage-{{ (item.triage or 'unknown') | lower }}">{{ item.signal_status }}</span><span class="tag {{ item.liquidity_class }}">{{ item.liquidity_band }}</span><span class="tag signal-risk-{{ item.signal_risk_label|lower }}">Signal Risk: {{ item.signal_risk_label }}</span></div>
            <div class="symbol-row"><h3>{{ item.symbol }}</h3><span class="bucket">{{ item.bucket }}</span></div>
            <div class="name">{{ item.name }}</div>
            <div class="decision-box"><strong>{{ item.decision_label }}</strong><span>{{ item.decision_reason }}</span></div>
            <div class="metric-grid"><div><span>1D</span><strong class="{{ item.return_1d_pct_class }}">{{ item.return_1d_pct | fmt_pct }}</strong></div><div><span>5D</span><strong class="{{ item.return_5d_pct_class }}">{{ item.return_5d_pct | fmt_pct }}</strong></div><div><span>RVOL</span><strong>{{ item.volume_ratio_20d | fmt_score }}</strong></div></div>
            <div class="component-bars"><div><span>Volume</span><i style="width:{{ item.component_widths.volume }}%"></i></div><div><span>Compression</span><i style="width:{{ item.component_widths.compression }}%"></i></div><div><span>Breakout</span><i style="width:{{ item.component_widths.breakout }}%"></i></div><div><span>RS</span><i style="width:{{ item.component_widths.relative_strength }}%"></i></div></div>
            <div class="flags">{% for flag in item.strict_good_flags[:3] %}<span class="good">{{ flag }}</span>{% endfor %}{% for flag in item.high_risk_flags[:2] %}<span class="danger">{{ flag }}</span>{% endfor %}{% for flag in item.medium_risk_flags[:2] %}<span class="warn">{{ flag }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>
          </article>
        {% else %}
          <article class="empty-card action-empty"><strong>No Trade or Monitor today.</strong><span>The model did not find a short-term setup strong enough to act on. Review blocked high-score names as a watchlist only.</span></article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="blocked-section">
      <div class="section-heading split-heading"><div><div class="kicker">BLOCKED HIGH SCORE</div><h2>Strong tape, no trigger yet.</h2></div><div class="method-chip">Top {{ blocked_display_limit }} only · watchlist material, not buy signals</div></div>
      <div class="cards compact-cards">
        {% for item in blocked_high_score_items %}
          <article class="signal-card blocked-card {{ item.score_class }} {% if item.has_high_risk %}severe{% endif %}">
            <div class="card-top"><div class="rank">#{{ item.rank }}</div><div class="score">{{ item.score_display }}<span>pts</span></div></div>
            <div class="symbol-row"><h3>{{ item.symbol }}</h3><span class="tag triage-ignore">{{ item.signal_status }}</span></div>
            <div class="name">{{ item.name }}</div>
            <div class="decision-box"><strong>{{ item.decision_label }}</strong><span>{{ item.decision_reason }}</span></div>
            <div class="mini-metrics"><span class="{{ item.return_1d_pct_class }}">1D {{ item.return_1d_pct | fmt_pct }}</span><span class="{{ item.return_5d_pct_class }}">5D {{ item.return_5d_pct | fmt_pct }}</span><span>{{ item.liquidity_band }}</span></div>
            <div class="flags">{% for flag in item.strict_good_flags[:2] %}<span class="good">{{ flag }}</span>{% endfor %}{% for flag in item.high_risk_flags[:2] %}<span class="danger">{{ flag }}</span>{% endfor %}{% for flag in item.medium_risk_flags[:2] %}<span class="warn">{{ flag }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>
          </article>
        {% else %}<article class="empty-card">No high-score blocked names today.</article>{% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="main-board-section">
      <div class="section-heading split-heading"><div><div class="kicker">MAIN DAILY BOARD</div><h2>Top {{ main_rank_limit }} ranked candidates.</h2></div><div class="method-chip">Compact decision table · rank equals score order</div></div>
      <div class="table-wrap decision-table">
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>Rank</th><th>Status</th><th>Symbol</th><th>Score</th><th>Setup / Blocker</th><th>1D</th><th>5D</th><th>Liquidity</th><th>Signal Risk</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            {% for item in main_items %}
              <tr class="row-{{ item.signal_status_class }}">
                <td>#{{ item.rank }}</td>
                <td><span class="mini-tag triage-{{ (item.triage or 'unknown') | lower }}">{{ item.signal_status }}</span></td>
                <td><strong>{{ item.symbol }}</strong><span>{{ item.name }}</span></td>
                <td><div class="score-cell"><strong>{{ item.score_display }}</strong><i style="width:{{ item.score_width }}%"></i></div></td>
                <td class="decision-cell">{{ item.decision_label }}</td>
                <td class="{{ item.return_1d_pct_class }}">{{ item.return_1d_pct | fmt_pct }}</td>
                <td class="{{ item.return_5d_pct_class }}">{{ item.return_5d_pct | fmt_pct }}</td>
                <td><span class="liq-pill {{ item.liquidity_class }}">{{ item.liquidity_band }}</span></td>
                <td><span class="signal-risk signal-risk-{{ item.signal_risk_label|lower }}">{{ item.signal_risk_label }}</span></td>
              </tr>
            {% endfor %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="insight-lanes-section">
      <div class="section-heading split-heading"><div><div class="kicker">SETUP INTELLIGENCE</div><h2>Validated positives and blockers.</h2></div><div class="method-chip">Strict favored flags only · risks split by severity</div></div>
      <div class="insight-lanes three">
        <article class="lane-card favored"><div class="lane-head"><span>STRICT FAVORED</span><strong>{{ favored_items|length }}</strong></div><div class="mini-list">{% for item in favored_items %}<div class="mini-row good"><strong>#{{ item.rank }} {{ item.symbol }}</strong><span>{{ item.strict_good_flags[0] }}</span><em>{{ item.score_display }} pts</em></div>{% else %}<div class="mini-empty">No strict favored setup in the main board.</div>{% endfor %}</div></article>
        <article class="lane-card danger"><div class="lane-head"><span>HIGH RISK</span><strong>{{ high_risk_items|length }}</strong></div><div class="mini-list">{% for item in high_risk_items %}<div class="mini-row danger"><strong>#{{ item.rank }} {{ item.symbol }}</strong><span>{{ item.high_risk_flags[0] }}</span><em>{{ item.signal_status }}</em></div>{% else %}<div class="mini-empty">No high-severity risk flags.</div>{% endfor %}</div></article>
        <article class="lane-card warning"><div class="lane-head"><span>MEDIUM RISK</span><strong>{{ medium_risk_items|length }}</strong></div><div class="mini-list">{% for item in medium_risk_items %}<div class="mini-row warn"><strong>#{{ item.rank }} {{ item.symbol }}</strong><span>{{ item.medium_risk_flags[0] }}</span><em>{{ item.signal_status }}</em></div>{% else %}<div class="mini-empty">No medium risk flags.</div>{% endfor %}</div></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="reference-section">
      <div class="section-heading split-heading"><div><div class="kicker">REFERENCE ONLY</div><h2>Rank 21–{{ reference_limit }} is lightweight context.</h2></div><div class="method-chip">Not part of the core Daily board</div></div>
      <div class="reference-grid slim">
        {% for item in reference_items[:12] %}<div class="reference-pill {% if item.has_high_risk %}risk{% elif item.has_strict_favored %}good{% endif %}"><strong>#{{ item.rank }} {{ item.symbol }} · {{ item.score_display }} pts</strong><span>{{ item.signal_status }} · 5D {{ item.return_5d_pct | fmt_pct }}</span></div>{% else %}<article class="empty-card">No reference items available.</article>{% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="method-section">
      <div class="method-card"><div class="kicker">METHODOLOGY</div><h2>Daily Event Score v2</h2><p>This page is a short-term decision board, not a generic momentum ranking. It rewards volume/liquidity shock, compression release, breakout setup, relative strength versus TOPIX and entry timing, while blocking noisy volume, distribution and exhaustion patterns.</p><div class="method-grid"><div><span>Volume / Liquidity</span><strong>24%</strong></div><div><span>Compression Release</span><strong>22%</strong></div><div><span>Breakout Setup</span><strong>20%</strong></div><div><span>Relative Strength</span><strong>16%</strong></div><div><span>Entry Timing</span><strong>15%</strong></div><div><span>Market Regime</span><strong>3%</strong></div></div></div>
      <div class="method-card warning"><div class="kicker">HOW TO READ</div><h2>Blocked can be useful.</h2><p>A high-score Blocked name can be the best watchlist for tomorrow. It is not a buy signal. Trade is the only actionable lane; Monitor Only requires next-day confirmation.</p></div>
    </section>

    <section class="notes"><strong>Not investment advice.</strong><span>Daily v2 excludes news, disclosures and fundamentals. It is a price/volume/timing signal layer only. Small-cap and low-liquidity stocks can move violently.</span></section>
    <footer class="footer"><span>Informational only. Not investment advice.</span><nav><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/japan/daily/backtest/">Backtest</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a><a href="/disclaimer/">Disclaimer</a></nav></footer>
  </main>
</div>
</body>
</html>
